{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/batch' data-target='computer\/programming\/batch' data-title='Batch'>\r\n\t\t\tBatch\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Notes: redirect stderr to stdout, | find /i \"search_string\", Concatenate Variables, Set X=Y, Set Y=Z, and Echo %%X%%.","label":"Notes","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/batch\/if_else","label":"if - else","url":"\/computer\/programming\/batch\/if_else"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/batch\/script_syntax","label":"Script Syntax","url":"\/computer\/programming\/batch\/script_syntax"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/programming\/batch\/notes.svg' alt='Working notes on Notes: redirect stderr to stdout, | find \/i \\&quot;search_string\\&quot;, Concatenate Variables, Set X=Y, Set Y=Z, and Echo %%X%%.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on Notes: redirect stderr to stdout, | find \/i \\\"search_string\\\", Concatenate Variables, Set X=Y, Set Y=Z, and Echo %%X%%.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCmd pipe to clipboard.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t| clip.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>redirect stderr to stdout<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t2&gt;&amp;1.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFind in output.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>| find \/i \"search_string\"<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%ErrorLevel% 0:Success 1:Failure<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Concatenate Variables<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\u201cxyz%var1%abc\u201d.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDouble Resolution does not work.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Set X=Y<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%X% = Y<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Set Y=Z<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%Y%=Z<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Echo %%X%%<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%Y%<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAnd not Z.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Set var=%1%)<\/h2>\n\t<h4>closing brace should be immediate<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tElse results in spaces.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTrim set Target=%Target:~0,-16%.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Pause<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>{Emulate} ping -n 10 127.0.0.1 &gt; Nul<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Goto<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Goto :&lt;Label|EoF&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t@GoTo :EoF.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/batch\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/batch\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/batch\/if_else' data-target='computer\/programming\/batch\/if_else' data-title='if - else' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>if - else<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/batch\/script_syntax' data-target='computer\/programming\/batch\/script_syntax' data-title='Script Syntax' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Script Syntax<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming\/batch' data-target='computer\/programming\/batch' data-title='Batch'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Batch<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}